<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Field Notes, an independent personal publication.">
  <section class="about-grid"><h1>Made with attention.</h1><div class="about-copy"><p>Field Notes is a personal publication about the ideas, tools, work, and small observations that reward a closer look.</p><p>It is deliberately independent: written slowly, published when ready, and designed to make reading feel like the main event.</p><p>This site is built with open-source tools and hosted on GitHub Pages. No trackers, subscriptions, or algorithms are required to spend time here.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
